## Description
The image is based on **Ruby 3.1.0** and includes all required dependencies for a production Rails environment.  
It installs system libraries, installs gems via Bundler, runs database migrations, precompiles assets,  
and starts the Rails server in production mode on port **3000**.

## Build and Run

docker build -t rails-app .
docker run -p 3000:3000 rails-app
